#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:1
#: 45bf05ac43d148dbac6032b1d722dc82
msgid "快速找出短键和净力异常结构"
msgstr "Quickly Find Short Bonds and Net-Force Outliers"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:3
#: 8ebf64c0290244f78f2a4bd868b62aa1
msgid ""
"训练前先做一次结构体检，通常能提前发现原子重叠、周期边界错误或未收敛的力。这"
"里用两个互补入口建立“待复核列表”，程序不会自动删除任何结构。"
msgstr ""
"A quick structural check before training can expose overlapping atoms, "
"periodic-boundary mistakes, and unconverged forces. The two complementary "
"checks below build a review list; neither check removes structures "
"automatically."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:5
#: 35f8243fedb04a558ab9ba1e5e44815a
msgid "运行两项检查"
msgstr "Run Both Checks"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:7
#: 25a9d88aab004a79bc0ace9de67b9ce8
msgid ""
"在工具栏中依次使用 `Find non-physical structures` 和 `Check net force`："
msgstr ""
"Use `Find non-physical structures` and then `Check net force` on the toolbar:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:9
#: cb3c1a3d990745b4a68da41c2bb77b16
msgid "非物理距离和净力检查入口"
msgstr "Entry points for nonphysical-distance and net-force checks"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:9
#: cb3c1a3d990745b4a68da41c2bb77b16
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/structure_quality_checks.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/structure_quality_checks.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:14
#: 36a4539b82f34ebbaae191c5c9917ce8
msgid ""
"短键检查使用 `Settings` 中的半径系数。默认 `0.7` 表示：两原子距离小于其共价半"
"径之和的 `0.7` 倍时，结构会被选中。它适合发现明显碰撞，不是材料通用的成键判"
"据。"
msgstr ""
"The short-distance check uses the radius coefficient in `Settings`. With the "
"default value `0.7`, a structure is selected when an interatomic distance is "
"below `0.7` times the sum of the two covalent radii. This is useful for "
"obvious collisions, not as a universal bonding criterion."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:16
#: 826c45832ce6400b9e739d616b263d89
msgid "净力检查在弹窗中填写阈值，单位是 `eV/Å`："
msgstr "Enter the net-force threshold in the dialog, in `eV/Å`:"

