#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:23
#: 9bed9893221f451abae13a201fd512e0
msgid ""
"程序计算每个结构的 $|\\sum_i \\mathbf{F}_i|$。本例用 `0.1 eV/Å` 做演示；真实"
"阈值应结合计算精度和体系大小决定。"
msgstr ""
"The program evaluates $|\\sum_i \\mathbf{F}_i|$ for each structure. This "
"example uses `0.1 eV/Å`; choose a production threshold based on the "
"calculation accuracy and system size."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:25
#: 805ea603e3da4af8b169aed735e94e81
msgid "把选中结果当作复核清单"
msgstr "Treat the Selection as a Review List"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:27
#: ae16728de0b2484fb67ee6e87679e16b
