#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/clean-suspicious-structures.md:32
#: 431427df26764575930fb0f5c15dd28e
msgid ""
"演示数据中人为加入了一个原子重叠和一个净力异常，真实检查后共选中 2 个结构。请"
"逐个查看几何、周期边界和对应 DFT 输出，确认是计算失败还是合理的高能构型。建议"
"先导出选中结构留档，再删除确认无效的数据；如果误删，可以立即使用撤销删除。"
msgstr ""
"The demo data contain one deliberately introduced atomic overlap and one net-"
"force outlier; the real checks select two structures in total. Inspect their "
"geometry, periodic boundaries, and original DFT output to distinguish "
"calculation failures from legitimate high-energy configurations. Export the "
"selection for reference before removing confirmed invalid data. If you "
"remove the wrong structure, use undo immediately."
